### PHASE 21: LEGACY ROUTE RETIREMENT & ROUTE AUTHORIZATION MATRIX

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@userToken = Bearer <USER_JWT>
@mentorToken = Bearer <MENTOR_JWT>
@adminToken = Bearer <ADMIN_JWT>
@superUserToken = Bearer <SUPERUSER_JWT>

### 1. Retired Governance Report Creation -> 410 LEGACY_ENDPOINT_REMOVED
POST {{baseUrl}}/governance/reports
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": "3",
  "reason": "Legacy report endpoint should be retired"
}

### 2. Retired Governance List -> 410 LEGACY_ENDPOINT_REMOVED
GET {{baseUrl}}/governance/reports
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### 3. Retired Governance Get One -> 410 LEGACY_ENDPOINT_REMOVED
GET {{baseUrl}}/governance/reports/report-1
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### 4. Retired Governance Resolve -> 410 LEGACY_ENDPOINT_REMOVED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/governance/reports/report-1/resolve
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "Warn",
  "resolution": "Legacy resolution bypass"
}

### 5. Retired Mentorship Apply -> 410 LEGACY_ENDPOINT_REMOVED
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentorship/apply
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "linkedinURL": "https://linkedin.com/in/example",
  "experienceYears": 2,
  "motivation": "Legacy mentor apply bypass"
}

### 6. Retired Mentorship Application Lookup (with spoofed x-userid) -> 410 LEGACY_ENDPOINT_REMOVED
GET {{baseUrl}}/mentorship/application
Authorization: {{userToken}}
x-user-id: 3
x-userid: 3

### 7. Retired Mentorship Review -> 410 LEGACY_ENDPOINT_REMOVED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/mentorship/application/app-1/review
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Approved"
}

### 8. Canonical Replacements Still Enforce Policies
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reportedUserId": "3",
  "reason": "Harassment",
  "details": "Detailed canonical report exceeding 20 characters."
}

### 9. Canonical Mentor Application Lookup Ignores Spoofed x-userid / ?userId=
GET {{baseUrl}}/mentor-applications/me?userId=3
Authorization: {{userToken}}
x-user-id: 3
x-userid: 3

### 10. Kept Mentorship Badge Endpoint Uses Verified JWT Identity
GET {{baseUrl}}/mentorship/badges/2
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### 11. Locked Test-Only Expiry Endpoint Rejects Non-SuperUsers (403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/test-set-expiry
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expiryMs": 60000
}
